			"notes": "Additions (by Sunconure11, huge thanks!):\n\n- Ported to 1.18.2\n\n- Added Deathstones, a new red variant of Lightstones (reference to [The Chamber of Death](https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbiosector01.com%252fwiki%252fChamber_of_Death)) that spawns deep underground.\n\n- Added Deepslate versions of Lightstone Ore and Deathstone Ore \n\n- Added Music Disc - 'The Makuta'\n\n\nChanges (by Sunconure11)\n\n- Fixed Skrall banner drops (with help from MrSterner)\n\n\n \nAdditions (by Paperdomo101)\n\n- Added Mata Nui Stone and Makuta Stone blocks, which play a sound when they fall.\n\n- Added Skrall banner pattern\n\n- Added Music Discs - 'The Telescope' and 'The End'\n\n\nChanges (by Paperdomo101)\n\n- Fixed Music Discs not playing from Jukebox (made audio files mono)"
